        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MS0030, Solid Brass Heavy Duty Mail Door Slot</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplete packaged solid brass heavy duty mail door slots. Package includes exterior mail door, interior trim bezel for mail slot opening and installation screws. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-MS0030-size.gif?v=1704354595\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MS0030 Mail Door Slot  Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MS0030 Mail Door Slot:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Hole Centers: 12\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Hole Centers: 1-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Opening Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Mail Door Opening: 90 degrees</li>\r\n<li>Spring Loaded Exterior Flap</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MS0030.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MS0030 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the mail slot door will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYou can add a <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-letter-box-sleeve-deltana-mss005\"><b>Deltana MSS005 Stainless Steel Letter Box Sleeve</b></a> if needed from the drop down menu below. The sleeves are typically used on 1-3/4\" thick commercial hollow metal doors.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass Heavy Duty Mail Door | Deltana MS0030",
                "description": "Deltana MS0030 - Heavy Duty Solid Brass mail slot door and inside trim bezel.  Available in 9 different finishes, comes with matching screws. 13 inches long by 3 1/16 inches high.",
